WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.034 --> 00:00:11.948
The Carters went horseback riding.

2
00:00:11.948 --> 00:00:16.027
"This is fun," Emmy said.

3
00:00:16.027 --> 00:00:19.485
"Yee-haw!" said Harry.

4
00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:24.233
"I'm a cowboy!"

5
00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:28.385
Harry's horse was named Buddy.

6
00:00:28.385 --> 00:00:32.210
"Go faster, Buddy!" Harry said

7
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.943
The horse blinked.

8
00:00:34.943 --> 00:00:39.391
He did not go faster.

9
00:00:39.391 --> 00:00:43.974
"These horses are for new riders," said the guide.

10
00:00:43.974 --> 00:00:47.225
"They are slow and gentle.

11
00:00:47.225 --> 00:00:51.059
They are not supposed to gallop."

12
00:00:51.059 --> 00:00:55.140
"I'm a cowboy," Harry thought.

13
00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:59.665
"And cowboys' horses gallop!"

14
00:00:59.665 --> 00:01:03.238
Harry tapped the horse with his heels.

15
00:01:03.238 --> 00:01:06.480
Buddy moved faster.

16
00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:09.661
"That's better!" Harry said.

17
00:01:09.661 --> 00:01:14.751
But Buddy slowed down again.

18
00:01:14.751 --> 00:01:18.846
Oliver laughed.

19
00:01:18.846 --> 00:01:23.858
"Buddy knows you're not a real cowboy!"

20
00:01:23.858 --> 00:01:26.129
Harry frowned.

21
00:01:26.129 --> 00:01:30.481
"I'll show Buddy that I'm a real cowboy!"

22
00:01:30.481 --> 00:01:36.983
He shouted as loudly as he could. "Yee-haw!"

23
00:01:36.983 --> 00:01:39.176
Buddy jerked his head.

24
00:01:39.176 --> 00:01:43.216
He jumped in the air and then galloped!

25
00:01:43.216 --> 00:01:49.235
"Whoa!" Harry cried.

26
00:01:49.235 --> 00:01:51.861
Harry dropped the reins.

27
00:01:51.861 --> 00:01:57.524
He slipped sideways in the saddle.

28
00:01:57.524 --> 00:02:01.409
"Help!" Harry yelled.

29
00:02:01.409 --> 00:02:04.750
The guide raced after Buddy.

30
00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:08.990
He grabbed the reins.

31
00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:16.534
"Loud noises can scare horses," the guide said.

32
00:02:16.535 --> 00:02:18.936
Dad looked angry.

33
00:02:18.937 --> 00:02:21.768
"Follow the rules, Harry."

34
00:02:21.769 --> 00:02:24.970
"Sorry," Harry said.

35
00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:29.429
He took the reins.

36
00:02:29.429 --> 00:02:33.031
Then Harry patted Buddy.

37
00:02:33.031 --> 00:02:37.401
"I won't be a cowboy today," he said.

38
00:02:37.401 --> 00:02:50.416
"I'll just be Harry—very quietly."
